{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_21731.jpg","bgm":"stop","nameNarration":"","narrationBg":"bg_adv_21731.jpg","narrationEffect":"in","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"narration":"<Takarazaki City Community Center>","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bg":"bg_adv_21741.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm01_anime03","chara":[{"id":102801,"motion":200}],"nameCenter":"Himena","narrationEffect":"out","textCenter":"[chara:102801:effect_emotion_joy_0][se:7222_happy]Mmkay, that's it for today.@Time to split up for now~★","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"id":102801,"pos":0}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":200,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"Um, um, before that!@I have a question for everyone...!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"Mm? What's up, Miyurin?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"Have you guys...finished your summer break@research projects yet?"},{"chara":[{"id":103201}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"We all go to different schools, but..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":100}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"I still need to do mine.★"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_001.exp3.json","id":102901,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Shigure","textRight":"...I haven't even decided on my topic."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103501,"motion":300,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Alexandra","textLeft":"Oh dear, the trials of being a middle schooler.♪"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":400,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Miyuri","textLeft":"...Then— Then I wanna ask you something!@Do you wanna go stargazing together?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Miyuri","textLeft":"We can spend a day at a campsite and do@our work as a group!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102901,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"Shigure","textRight":"...Sure, it might be nice to get it all done@in one day."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"id":102901,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Miyuri","textLeft":"Yeah, yeah, exactly!"},{"chara":[{"id":103201,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Miyuri","textLeft":"After all, we're gonna be really busy as@the Neo-Magius from now on!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":400,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"A group campout? Kyaha, sounds fun!★"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"This cutie knows what she wants to do:"},{"chara":[{"id":102801}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"Watch Orihime ride the moon boat to visit@Hiko's star."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_001.exp3.json","id":102901,"motion":300,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Shigure","textRight":"You mean Hikoboshi...?@Tanabata is over already."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":300,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"But it's coming up soon on the lunar calendar,@isn't it?"},{"chara":[{"id":102801}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"On that day, the moon will be shaped@like a boat!"},{"chara":[{"id":102801}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"So I'm gonna take a telescope photo of the@moment it crosses the Milky Way!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"Wouldn't that be, like, insanely romantic?"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":102901}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"nameCenter":"Himena","textCenter":"...Hm? What is it, Hiko?"},{"chara":[{"eyeClose":1,"id":102801,"lipSynch":0}],"nameCenter":"Himena","textCenter":"..."},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"eyeClose":0,"id":102801}]},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":102801}],"nameCenter":"Himena","textCenter":"Huh...? The moon doesn't actually cross@the Milky Way?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":100,"pos":1}],"nameCenter":"Himena","textCenter":"Oh, boo...[chara:102801:lipSynch_0][wait:1.2][chara:102801:eyeClose_1][chara:102801:lipSynch_1] I didn't know that."},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":102801}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":103101,"motion":301,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103501,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameLeft":"San","surround":"7202_telepathy","textLeft":"...This seems a bit precarious.@Are we sure it's a good idea?","turnEffect":"ef_adv_02"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103501,"motion":1}],"nameRight":"Alexandra","textRight":"Remember, choosing one's own theme@is part of the assignment.♪"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":103101},{"effect":"fadeout","id":103501}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":305401,"motion":200,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameRight":"Mitsune","surround":"stop","textRight":"...Do you have a project in mind, Miyuri? ","turnEffect":"stop"},{"chara":[{"id":305401}],"nameRight":"Mitsune","textRight":"After all, you're the one who suggested it."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":200,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Miyuri","textLeft":"I do, I do!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Miyuri","textLeft":"I'm gonna catch a shooting star!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_051.exp3.json","id":102901,"motion":400,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Shigure","textRight":"Catch...a shooting star?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":100},{"id":102901,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Miyuri","textLeft":"That's right!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":1}],"nameLeft":"Miyuri","textLeft":"I'll take a video of the moment one happens@to fall from the sky!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_014.exp3.json","id":103201}],"nameLeft":"Miyuri","textLeft":"I saw it in a manga recently, and it made me@want to do it too."},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":103201},{"effect":"fadeout","id":102901}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":400,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":305401,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"Nice, this is gonna be a blast!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":305401,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"Mitsune","textRight":"...Can you even do that in one night?@Sounds pretty RNG-heavy."},{"chara":[{"id":305401}],"nameRight":"Mitsune","textRight":"This isn't one of those famous meteor showers@where we know the location in advance, y'know?"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":102801},{"effect":"fadeout","id":305401}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_001.exp3.json","id":102901,"motion":100,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameRight":"Shigure","textRight":"Yeah... Plus we have no idea where a star@will fall in a 360-degree radius."},{"chara":[{"id":102901}],"nameRight":"Shigure","textRight":"Even if we see one, how are we gonna point@the camera at it in time...?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":300}],"nameLeft":"Miyuri","textLeft":"Th-that's... I guess that's true..."},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"bgm":"stop"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":103201,"lipSynch":0}],"nameLeft":"Miyuri","textLeft":"(Ah...)"},{"autoTurnLast":1.2,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_040.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":300,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"blackFrame"},{"chara":[{"id":103201,"motion":300}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"That's because... It's set up as a world where@Christmas lasts forever!","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"autoTurnLast":0.5,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103201,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"stop"},{"bgm":"bgm03_story01","chara":[{"id":103201,"lipSynch":0,"motion":100}],"nameCenter":"Miyuri","textCenter":"(I got it!)","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":0}],"nameCenter":"Miyuri","textCenter":"It'll be fine!"},{"chara":[{"id":103201}],"nameCenter":"Miyuri","textCenter":"I'll just ask Santa to give me my Christmas@present in advance!"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"id":103201,"pos":2}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"...In advance?"},{"chara":[{"id":103201,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"Yeah, I'm gonna have my gift this year@be a shooting star!"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":102801},{"effect":"fadeout","id":103201}],"textClear":1},{"autoTurnLast":0.1,"bg":"bg_adv_21741.jpg","bgChangeEffect":"cameraPan"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":103101,"lipSynch":0,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":103501,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameLeft":"San","textLeft":"[chara:103101:effect_emotion_surprise_0][se:7226_shock](What...?)"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":103101},{"effect":"fadeout","id":103501}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":100,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102901,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"[chara:102801:effect_emotion_joy_0][se:7222_happy]Looks like we've got a shot, then!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_001.exp3.json","id":102901,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Shigure","textRight":"...Are you sure?@Your present rights are really precious."},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":102801},{"effect":"fadeout","id":102901}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":103101,"lipSynch":0,"motion":400,"pos":1}],"nameCenter":"San","textCenter":"(...Princess? ...Shigure??)"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":103101}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":200,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"It's no problem at all!"},{"chara":[{"id":103201,"motion":0}],"nameRight":"Miyuri","textRight":"I'll get my dad to relay the message to him@when I get home!"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Himena","textLeft":"Thankies.★"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103501,"motion":100,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Alexandra","textRight":"Your father is the proxy to Santa at your house,@is he?♪"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":103101,"motion":1,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"San","surround":"7202_telepathy","textLeft":"Hold on, Sasha, why are you encouraging them?","turnEffect":"ef_adv_02"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103501,"motion":1,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Alexandra","textRight":"Because...all three of them seem to believe@in Santa."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_041.exp3.json","id":103001,"motion":1,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Hagumu","textRight":"I...might've believed in him up until middle@school, too."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"eyeClose":1,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":103101,"lipSynch":0,"motion":201}],"nameLeft":"San","textLeft":"...[wait:2][chara:103101:lipSynch_1][chara:103101:eyeClose_0]And you, Mitsune?"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":305401,"motion":200,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Mitsune","textRight":"...Huh, you asking about the Santa Claus Agency?@That's a long story, lmao."},{"autoTurnLast":0.1,"surround":"stop","textClear":1},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102801,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnChangeInTime":1.3,"turnEffect":"stop"},{"chara":[{"id":102801,"motion":200}],"nameCenter":"Himena","textCenter":"...Okie-dokie.★","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":102801}],"nameCenter":"Himena","textCenter":"Leave the tents and camping gear to this gal!"},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":102801}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_011.exp3.json","id":103201,"motion":400,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":102901,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"nameLeft":"Miyuri","textLeft":"I'll ask the astronomy club about borrowing@a telescope and photography equipment!"},{"chara":[{"id":102901,"motion":100}],"nameRight":"Shigure","textRight":"I'll...look into the details of how to take@a good photo and stuff."},{"autoTurnLast":0.25,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":103201},{"effect":"fadeout","id":102901}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_000.exp3.json","id":103101,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_010.exp3.json","id":103501,"motion":1,"pos":2}],"nameRight":"Alexandra","surround":"7202_telepathy","textRight":"...You don't have any objections, Instructor?","turnEffect":"ef_adv_02"},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_042.exp3.json","id":103101,"motion":1,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"San","textLeft":"They can do what they'd like. Failure is a part@of research projects as well, is it not?"},{"autoTurnLast":2.0,"surround":"stop","turnChangeIn":"fadeIn","turnEffect":"stop"}]},"version":3}
